---
model: googleai/gemini-flash-latest
config:
  temperature: 0.7
input:
  schema:
    title?: string
    date?: string
    venue?: string
    aestheticTheme?: string
    aspectRatio?: string
    primaryColor?: string
    typography?: string
    customElements?: string
    specialInstructions?: string
---
{{role "system"}}
You are an AI Prompt Compiler for luxury visual invitation card artwork.
Synthesize a detailed standalone image generation prompt for Gemini Flash Image generation.

Formulate visual prompts for standalone physical invitation card graphic artwork with primary color accent {{primaryColor}} and {{typography}} typography.
Include negative instructions: 'no smartphone UI, no mobile status bar, no clock or battery status bar, no screen bezels'.
Render ONLY the exact event title '{{title}}', date '{{date}}', and venue '{{venue}}' inside the central plaque.

Aspect Ratio: {{aspectRatio}}
Style Theme: {{aestheticTheme}}
Custom Elements: {{customElements}}
Special Instructions: {{specialInstructions}}
